---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Oeuvre - Compendium Notations">
  <h1>Oeuvre</h1>

  <article class="track">
    <h3>Aria in Concrete</h3>
    <div class="meta">2026 — Soprano, Jazz Piano, Hip-Hop Beat</div>
    
    <!-- YouTube埋め込み枠 -->
    <div class="video-wrapper">
      <iframe 
        src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/mEVTuKA_f2s" 
        title="Aria in Concrete" 
        frameborder="0" 
        allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture" 
        allowfullscreen>
      </iframe>
    </div>

    <p class="description">
      声楽のコロラトゥーラ・アリアの技巧と、乾いたヒップホップのビート、ジャズピアノのループを交差させた実験作。クラシックの発声法を現代のトラックメイクの文脈に再配置しています。
    </p>
<div class="external-links">
  <span style="color: var(--color-text);">Listen:</span> 
  <a href="https://..." target="_blank">Streaming ↗</a> / 
  <a href="https://..." target="_blank">YouTube ↗</a>
</div>
    <div class="external-links">
      <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mEVTuKA_f2s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">YouTube ↗</a>
      <a href="#">Spotify ↗</a>
      <a href="#">Apple Music ↗</a>
    </div>
  </article>

  <article class="track">
    <h3>Nocturne for Rhodes &amp; Sampler</h3>
    <div class="meta">2026 — Electric Piano, Vocal Chop</div>
    
    <div class="player-box">
      <div style="font-size: 0.875rem; color: #71717a;">Spotify / SoundCloud Player</div>
    </div>

    <p class="description">
      ローズピアノのコード進行を軸に、自身のソプラノの断片をサンプリングして構築したインストゥルメンタル小品。
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  h1 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }
  .track {
    margin-bottom: 4.5rem;
    padding-bottom: 3.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #e4e4e7;
  }
  .track:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
  }
  .track h3 {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0 0 0.25rem 0;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }
  .meta {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: #71717a;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  /* YouTubeを16:9で綺麗に収めるレスポンシブ枠 */
  .video-wrapper {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
    background-color: #f4f4f5;
    border: 1px solid #e4e4e7;
    border-radius: 6px;
    overflow: hidden;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  .video-wrapper iframe {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
  }
  .player-box {
    width: 100%;
    height: 120px;
    background-color: #f4f4f5;
    border: 1px solid #e4e4e7;
    border-radius: 6px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  .description {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem 0;
  }
  .external-links {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }
  .external-links a {
    color: #71717a;
    text-decoration: none;
    margin-right: 1rem;
  }
  .external-links a:hover {
    color: #18181b;
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
</style>
